      "page": "page-1",
      "text": "Bold typographic × dark luminous.\n\nArchivo 800 numerals on near-black, Space Grotesk for everything else. Each occasion carries one accent colour — that colour is the only thing that changes between them."
    },
    {
      "id": "glance-note",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -198,
      "w": 470,
      "page": "page-2",
      "text": "Every widget here is buildable in Glance.\n\nNo shadows, gradients, arcs or animation — Glance can't draw them. The luminous feel comes from colour alone: a saturated accent on near-black, inverting to a solid accent block on the day itself."
    }
